title: "DD-CoMB: Dempster-Dirichlet Combination of Multiple Backbones"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of DD-CoMB, a parameter-free evidential decision-level
  combination of frozen heterogeneous pretrained backbones for reliable few-shot
  out-of-domain image classification.
